// Member 3 (aug06dhz0 fuzz divergence_000000, 2026-08-06,
// PRE-EXISTING — deterministic on e5a2e1bd too): the interp-side arm
// union of a never()-armed select RETAINS the never arm's orphan
// unbound cell as a set member; bare tvars sort first, the strict
// pass rejects every member (the structured member has Any leaves =
// blind under Strict), and the old single-tier plain fallback picked
